- [Service-Managed Standard: AWS Control Tower](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/latest/userguide/service-managed-standard-aws-control-tower.md): Understand how the Service-Managed Standard: AWS Control Tower works in AWS Security Hub CSPM.
- [Enabling a standard](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/latest/userguide/enable-standards.md): Learn how to enable a security standard in AWS Security Hub CSPM.
