- [Turning off auto-enabled standards](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/latest/userguide/securityhub-auto-enabled-standards.md): Learn how to turn off the automatic enablement of default security standards in AWS Security Hub CSPM.
- [Disabling a standard](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/latest/userguide/disable-standards.md): Learn how to disable security standards in AWS Security Hub CSPM.

